    "enemies": "Workspace.AppleEnemies: live enemies tagged AppleEnemy and AppleCreature, attributes Health, MaxHealth, Reward, Enemy; set Health lower and LastHitBy to hit one",
    "rewards": "a defeated enemy's Reward goes to the player who hit it last (or everyone)",
